# The untracked local seam.
#
# Everything specific to one machine or one employer lives in files of this
# shape, and this repo is public: nothing matching them may ever be committed,
# whether it is a stray copy someone drops in the working tree or a file a tool
# writes here. The seam itself lives in $HOME (~/.zshrc.local,
# ~/.gitconfig.local, ~/.gitconfig.work), not in this directory - these
# patterns exist so that a copy landing here is caught rather than staged.
# See README.md.
*.local
*.local.*
.gitconfig.work
gitconfig.work

# macOS + nix build noise
.DS_Store
result
result-*
.flake-settings.*

# no-mistakes local validation state - never commit in this public repo
.no-mistakes/
